  "body": "CCC and Title Issued: Move in immediately!\r\n\r\nWelcome to a home where every detail is designed with you in mind—bathed in natural sunlight, finished to perfection, and ready for you to make unforgettable memories. This isn’t just a residence; it’s an invitation to elevate your lifestyle in one of Auckland’s most coveted neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\n\r\n- Four Generous Bedrooms & 3.5 Designer Bathrooms\r\n- Secure Double Garage: Peace of mind with ample space for vehicles and storage\r\n- True Freehold Ownership: No body corporate fees—enjoy total independence\r\n- 10-Year Master Build Guarantee for peace of mind\r\n\r\nVersatility at Its Finest – The Ground Floor\r\n\r\nWhether you’re welcoming extended family, hosting guests, or working from home, the flexible ensuited bedroom with its own private entrance adapts to your needs. With thoughtful additions like ample storage, a dedicated laundry, and an double garage, convenience is always at your fingertips.\r\n\r\nThe Entertainer’s Main Level\r\n\r\nStep into a light-filled, open-plan living space perfect for gatherings both large and small. The gourmet kitchen is a chef’s dream, featuring a walk-in butler’s pantry, gas cooking, and sleek, modern finishes. Enjoy seamless indoor-outdoor flow to your expansive balcony—the ideal spot for brunches, sunset dinners, and relaxed evenings with loved ones. A stylish powder room completes the entertainer’s haven.\r\n\r\n\r\nYour Private Retreat Upstairs\r\n\r\nUnwind in your tranquil master suite, complete with a spacious walk-in wardrobe, elegant double vanity, and air conditioning for year-round comfort. Two additional sun-drenched bedrooms share a beautifully appointed bathroom with a luxurious bathtub—perfect for restful nights and peaceful mornings.\r\n\r\nUnbeatable Location – The Heart of Takapuna\r\n\r\nLive moments from the best that Takapuna has to offer—stroll to the iconic beach, browse boutique shops, indulge in local cafés and world-class dining, or relax by the serene Lake Pupuke. Top schools, North Shore Hospital, and effortless motorway access mean everything you need is right at your doorstep.\r\n\r\n\r\nOpportunities like this are rare.\r\nDiscover the comfort, versatility, and prestige you deserve—contact us today to arrange your private viewing and secure your place at Takapuna’s newest luxury address.",
